# The offline snapshot is the whole handbook — staff addresses, compensation,
# the lot — as one public JSON file. Publishing it would hand out everything
# the sign-in is there to protect, so it stays in the repo as a local backup
# and is not deployed. (It could never have been used anyway once sign-in was
# required: reaching it means Supabase is down, and signing in needs Supabase.)
content/

# Not part of the site: run these by hand in the Supabase SQL editor.
sql/
